ot;font-size:18px&quot;&gt;(Nadeau–Bengio) + Holm&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:18px&quot;&gt;complejidad: tiempo,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:18px&quot;&gt;memoria, tamaño&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F6F9;strokeColor=#0F2A47;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=12;align=center;fontColor=#1F2933;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1060" y="540" width="280" height="460" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="interp" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:19px;color:#0F2A47&quot;&gt;INTERPRETABILIDAD&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:18px&quot;&gt;coeficientes (M1, M2)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:18px&quot;&gt;permutación&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:18px&quot;&gt;SHAP (árboles)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:18px&quot;&gt;PDP / ICE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:18px&quot;&gt;asociación,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:18px&quot;&gt;no causalidad&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F6F9;strokeColor=#0F2A47;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=12;align=center;fontColor=#1F2933;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1380" y="540" width="260" height="460" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="res" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:18px;color:#0F2A47&quot;&gt;RESULTADOS Y&lt;br&gt;CONCLUSIONES&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:18px&quot;&gt;T12: piloto&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:18px&quot;&gt;T25: prueba&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:18px&quot;&gt;sellada&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F6F9;strokeColor=#0F2A47;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=12;align=center;fontColor=#1F2933;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1680" y="540" width="180" hei